    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Map serial-element counts, developmental gene expression and morphology onto vertebrate, arthropod and flowering-plant phylogenies to infer whether their ancestors had repeated similar modules subsequently differentiated. Reconstructed high repetition at the relevant ancestors supports the claim.";
